      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8961229::web::029::the_effect_of_constituent_phases_on_magn"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The solution-annealed AlCoFeNi-based alloy initially has a primarily single-phase A2/BCC structure.",
