      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The appropriate baseline is the same AlCoFeNi alloy in the solution-annealed state without aging.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coercivity should be compared near room temperature using samples processed identically apart from aging.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Aging outside the 600–700 °C and 2–4 hour window may reduce precipitation or alter the domain structure enough to negate the coercivity increase.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
